    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the paragraph says the person "must pay" and does not say what follows if the person does not

DECLARE `o 26 r 3(10) what the subscriber does` IS ONE OF
    `o 26 r 3(10)(a) search the information mentioned in paragraph (8)(a)`
    `o 26 r 3(10)(b) search for, inspect or take a copy of a document mentioned in paragraph (8)(b)`
    `o 26 r 3(10) something else`

-- src:4072 | (10) Despite paragraph (4), a subscriber of the service mentioned in paragraph (8) is entitled, at any time when that service is in operation — ( a )
-- src:4073 | to search the information mentioned in paragraph (8)( a ), without paying the prescribed fee mentioned in paragraph (4) and without obtaining the permission of the Registrar; and
-- src:4074 | ( b )
